          "id": "7fce4239d72e733467508b7657ed2099427d4db2",
          "message": "build(deps): Bump num-bigint from 0.4.6 to 0.5.1 (#1633)\n\n* build(deps): Bump num-bigint from 0.4.6 to 0.5.1\n\nBumps [num-bigint](https://github.com/rust-num/num-bigint) from 0.4.6 to 0.5.1.\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/rust-num/num-bigint/blob/master/RELEASES.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/rust-num/num-bigint/compare/num-bigint-0.4.6...num-bigint-0.5.1)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: num-bigint\n  dependency-version: 0.5.1\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-minor\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* fix(difftest): adapt BigInt→BigDecimal conversion for num-bigint 0.5 [OPUS-4.8]\n\nbigdecimal 0.4 implements From<num_bigint 0.4::BigInt> but not\nFrom<num_bigint 0.5::BigInt> (two separate semver-major instances in the\nlock file). Replace the two From-based conversions in numeric.rs with a\nvia-string path (BigInt::to_string → BigDecimal::from_str), which is\nlossless for integer values and avoids any version coupling. All 29\nsparq-difftest unit tests pass; clippy clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Wright <63333554+jeswr@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <jesse@jeswr.org>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-09T21:56:07Z",
